<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rose slightly at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.05 percent.</p>
<p>					Oct 16 fix	     Oct 16 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.02 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.05 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.13 pct		3.12 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.22 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.33 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
